File previews via tabbed XEmbed with persistent application state.  For text
MIME types, uview uses Neovim's server interface; for media files, mpv's IPC
socket; and for PDFs, Zathura over D-Bus.

uview is intended for FIFO-based file-manager preview workflows (such as nnn)
in an X11 session.  See [.AGENTS/README.md](.AGENTS/README.md) for the
repository's maintainer and agent workflow, including the current tabbed
selection issue and improvement backlog.

Use `uview --zen-mode [FIFO [FILE]]` to start Bookokrat document previews in
zen mode. The default leaves Bookokrat's sidebar visible.
